id=custom_bootanimation
name=QIMU - Boot Animation Manager
version=1.3.0
versionCode=130
author=LAmireuxP
description=Boot animation manager for HyperOS with multilingual WebUI. Apply, import, export, delete, reorder, convert video to animation, adjust resolution, health check, and preview boot animations. Restores stock animation when disabled or uninstalled. Supports KernelSU, SukiSU, APatch, FolkPatch, and Magisk.
